@startuml Project01_Activity_Predator
title Predator — what it does every cycle

start
:A predator wakes up for this cycle;
:Look around for nearby butterflies;

if (Any butterfly spotted?) then (yes)
  :Pick one to chase;

  if (Predator hunts by\npopularity of color? [Extension 1]) then (yes)
    :Judge how easy to catch\nbased on how common\nthat color is in the population;
    note right: the more common the color,\nthe more likely it gets targeted
  else (no — hunts by camouflage)
    :Judge how easy to catch\nbased on how well the butterfly\nblends into its surroundings;
    note right: better camouflage\nmeans harder to catch
  endif

  if (Does the predator\nsucceed in catching it?) then (yes)
    :The butterfly is caught and dies;
  else (no)
    :The butterfly gets away;
    :Predator chases after it;
  endif

else (no)
  :Nothing nearby, wander around randomly;
endif

stop

@enduml
